      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\n\nreturn items.map(item => {\n  const data = item.json;\n  const toEmail = data.email || data.toEmail || \"\";\n\n  const subject = \"A collaboration invitation from [Your Brand]\";\n\n  const htmlBody = `\n<div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222;\">\n  <p>Hello,</p>\n  \n  <p>Hope you’re having a great week!</p>\n  \n  <p>I'm [Your Name] from [Your Brand]. I came across your page recently and really love your style—your feed feels super natural and genuine, and we’d love to have you wear some of our pieces.</p>\n  \n  <p>We design high quality pieces made for daily wear. We want to send you some items to keep and kick off an ongoing partnership.</p>\n  \n  <p><strong>What we offer:</strong></p>\n  <ul style=\"padding-left: 20px; margin: 8px 0;\">\n    <li>3–4 pieces of your choice</li>\n    <li>$25 cash commission on every order placed with your code</li>\n    <li>An exclusive discount code for your community</li>\n    <li>Future gifted drops as we release new collections</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n  <p><strong>A quick heads-up on the arrangement:</strong><br>\n  We cover 100% of the cost of the pieces, but we do ask you to cover the shipping cost directly for this first package. Once you post and make your first sale through your code you will get your commission.</p>\n  \n  <p>No scripts or strict talking points—we just want you to style the pieces your way and share your honest thoughts.</p>\n  \n  <p>Check out our pieces at <a href=\"https://www.example.com\" style=\"color: #111; text-decoration: underline;\">example.com</a>. If this sounds good to you, reply here and I’ll send over your selection link!</p>\n  \n  <p style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">Warm regards,<br>\n  <strong>[Your Name]</strong><br>\n  Team | [Your Brand]</p>\n  \n  <hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 24px 0 16px 0;\" />\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; line-height: 1.5;\">\n    <p style=\"margin: 2px 0;\"><strong>[Your Brand]</strong> | [Your Tagline]</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 2px 0;\"><a href=\"https://www.example.com\" style=\"color: #666;\">www.example.com</a> &nbsp;|&nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:sender@example.com\" style=\"color: #666;\">sender@example.com</a></p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 2px 0;\">[Your Business Address]</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 6px 0 0 0;\">Enter our circle ✨ IG: <strong>@[YOUR_INSTAGRAM]</strong> | TikTok: <strong>@[YOUR_TIKTOK]</strong></p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  `;\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...data,\n      subject: subject,\n      html: htmlBody,\n      body: htmlBody,\n      toEmail: toEmail\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
